title = "Endless Struggle For Survival"

[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~mEndless Struggle For Survival</h2>
<br><i>~INemo patriam, quia magna est, amat, sed quia sua.
--Seneka<br></i>
<p>
You stumble upon a hidden base of the enemy.
This seems to be their base for reserves, this is where they get their power from.
$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
<h2>Your guards report:</h2>
<br>Master, this seems to be the enemies' base
for storing and distributing stormpower. What shall we do?
$Button=Attack,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Beats me - I don't know,MissionAbort,1



[@180]
<h2>~mSpying action</h2>
<br>You send out your spies to spy on the enemy for a while.
$Button=O.K. do it!,DoNothing,0

[@200]
<h2>~gA message from your spies</h2>
<br>We have infiltratred the enemy camp, and have found blueprints on
a secret technology that the enemy has been developing. We've stolen the knowledge
for you, master. 
$Button=O.K.,Tell,Share
$Button=No thanks,DoNothing,0

[Share]
Here is the enemies' secret technology, master!
$Button=OK,GetTechnology,139


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>~gVictory</h2>
<p>
Looks like the enemy just doesn't know who he's dealing with, master.
But if only you'd saved your ally in the previous mission...
Hopefully he's looking down at you right now... He would be very proud of you!
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Thundere1
$Button=I agree - but I've had enought,MissionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h2>~rA message from the enemy:</h2>
<p>
Look at your pitiful selves, you're no match for us, it seems that
those victories you've conducted earlier were nothing but ~mDUMB LUCK~!
$Button=Retry Mission,MissionBegin,Thunderd
$Button=Bail,MissionAbort,1

[End]
